'''Kruziikrel''' is a unique [[Skyrim:Dragon|dragon]] found inside the [[Skyrim:Black Book: Waking Dreams (book)|Black Book: Waking Dreams]] during the quest [[Skyrim:At the Summit of Apocrypha|At the Summit of Apocrypha]].

His name means "Ancient Domination" in the [[Lore:Dragon Language|dragon language]].
